<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>404 - Page Not Found | Mangalore University</title>
<link rel="icon" href="sites/default/files/mangalore-logo_0_0.jpg" type="image/jpeg">
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
<style>
:root {
  --mu-primary: #0d3b7a;
  --mu-primary-light: #1a5bb5;
  --mu-accent: #e8b84b;
  --mu-bg: #f4f6f9;
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  background: var(--mu-bg);
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  color: #2d3748;
}
.page-wrapper { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem; }
.error-card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 24px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(13, 59, 122, 0.08), 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  max-width: 720px;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.error-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 5px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mu-primary), var(--mu-accent));
}
.status-code {
  font-size: 8rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mu-primary), var(--mu-primary-light));
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  letter-spacing: -4px;
}
.status-icon {
  font-size: 3rem;
  color: var(--mu-primary);
  opacity: 0.15;
  position: absolute;
  top: 1.5rem; right: 2rem;
}
.error-title {
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--mu-primary);
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.error-desc {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: #64748b;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 480px;
  margin: 0 auto 2rem;
}
.search-box {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  max-width: 420px;
  margin: 0 auto 2rem;
}
.search-box input {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
  border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.search-box input:focus { border-color: var(--mu-primary-light); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(26, 91, 181, 0.1); }
.search-box button {
  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  background: var(--mu-primary);
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.search-box button:hover { background: var(--mu-primary-light); }
.action-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
  gap: 0.75rem;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}
.action-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
  color: #475569;
  background: #fff;
}
.action-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--mu-primary-light);
  color: var(--mu-primary);
  background: #f8fafc;
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}
.action-btn.primary {
  background: var(--mu-primary);
  color: #fff;
  border-color: var(--mu-primary);
}
.action-btn.primary:hover {
  background: var(--mu-primary-light);
  border-color: var(--mu-primary-light);
  color: #fff;
}
.error-footer {
  margin-top: 2rem;
  padding-top: 1.5rem;
  border-top: 1px solid #eef2f6;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: #94a3b8;
}
.error-footer a {
  color: var(--mu-primary-light);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.error-footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
@media (max-width: 576px) {
  .error-card { padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; }
  .status-code { font-size: 5.5rem; }
  .error-title { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .search-box { flex-direction: column; }
  .action-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}
</style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/whats-new.css?v=3">
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-wrapper">
  <div class="error-card">
    <i class="bi bi-question-circle status-icon"></i>

    <div class="status-code">404</div>
    <div class="error-title">Page Not Found</div>
    <p class="error-desc">
      The page you are looking for might have been removed, had its name changed,
      or is temporarily unavailable. Let us help you find what you need.
    </p>

    <form class="search-box" action="https://mangaloreuniversity.ac.in/" method="get" onsubmit="window.location.href='https://mangaloreuniversity.ac.in/' + document.getElementById('404-query').value.split(' ').join('-'); return false;">
      <input type="text" id="404-query" placeholder="Search the site..." aria-label="Search">
      <button type="submit"><i class="bi bi-search me-1"></i> Search</button>
    </form>

    <div class="action-grid">
      <a href="/" class="action-btn primary">
        <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i> Home
      </a>
      <a href="/latest-home-news.html" class="action-btn">
        <i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i> News
      </a>
      <a href="/contact-us-3.html" class="action-btn">
        <i class="bi bi-envelope"></i> Contact
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="action-btn" onclick="history.back(); return false;">
    <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Go Back
</a>
    </div>

    <div class="error-footer">
      <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>
      Report broken links at
      <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d0a7b5b2bdb1a3a4b5a290bdb1beb7b1bcbfa2b5a5beb9a6b5a2a3b9a4a9feb1b3feb9be"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="0b7c6e69666a787f6e794b666a656c6a6764796e7e65627d6e7978627f72256a68256265">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>
      &middot; <a href="./">Mangalore University</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

